# {{ project_name }} - Project rules

Rules for this repository only. The ones that apply to every project are in [`.claude/rules/core.md`](.claude/rules/core.md), which comes from the template and is not edited here. Rules for one part of the code go in a path-scoped file in [`.claude/rules/`](.claude/rules/); why the always-loaded rules stay short is in [`docs/ai-workflow/`](docs/ai-workflow/README.md).

